&=\int_t^\infty q_ke^{-q_ks}
   \prod_{j\ne k}\mathbb P(S_j>s)\,ds\\
&=\int_t^\infty q_ke^{-Qs}\,ds
=\boxed{\frac{q_k}{Q}e^{-Qt}}.
\end{aligned}
$$
This is the joint tail calculation for <competing exponential clocks>.

