and choose $\gamma$ so that the <integral> converges and $e^{zt}t^3f(t)$ vanishes at its endpoints. Solving the amplitude equation,
$$
\frac{f'}f=\frac2{t^3}-\frac3t,
\qquad
f(t)=Ct^{-3}e^{-1/t^2}.
