$$
\Omega'=-2(\Omega-1)\frac{\mathcal H'}{\mathcal H}
=(1+3w)\mathcal H\Omega(\Omega-1),
$$
where $\mathcal H^2+kc^2=\Omega\mathcal H^2$ was used in the last step.

