$$
R^\alpha{}_{\beta\mu\nu}T^\beta T^\mu S^\nu
=K\{T^\alpha(T\cdot S)-S^\alpha(T\cdot T)\}=KS^\alpha,
$$
because $T\cdot S=0$ and $T\cdot T=-1$. Therefore
$$
