Because decryption determines $M$ from $(C,K)$,
$$
H(M\mid C,K)=0.
$$
The chain rule and monotonicity give
$$
H(M\mid C)\leq H(M,K\mid C)
=H(K\mid C)+H(M\mid C,K)=H(K\mid C).
$$

