\qquad
\widehat s_*^2=\widetilde x_*^T\widehat V\widetilde x_*.
$$
An asymptotic confidence interval for the mean binary response $p_*=\Phi(\eta_*)$ is
$$
\left[
\Phi(\widehat\eta_*-z_{1-\alpha/2}\widehat s_*),
\Phi(\widehat\eta_*+z_{1-\alpha/2}\widehat s_*)
\right].
