$$
Then $p_n/q_n=[a_0,ldots,a_n]$. The <determinant> identity
$$
p_nq_{n-1}-p_{n-1}q_n=(-1)^{n-1}
$$
follows by induction. Writing the remaining complete quotient as $\theta_{n+1}>1$ gives
